cape lockout, with every number as data; the donor's swing gate (D2) and reduction formula (D1) are not copied and the reduction is fixed to a percent in the sketch.","decision_status":"proposed","acceptance":"A server test asserts that a 100-AP ability at 200 AP leaves 100 AP, that AP rises by 25 per 1000 ms with no global cooldown and by 0 on a 300 ms retry while one is active, and that a flee sets AP to 0 with no regen for 10000 ms."}
